WEBVTT

1
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:13,740
Thank you for your hard work in the summer. Come home.

2
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:15,300
Before the road is blocked

3
00:00:15,300 --> 00:00:22,210
Withdraw quickly enough

4
00:00:22,210 --> 00:00:24,710
If it's too late, it'll be me

5
00:00:24,710 --> 00:00:26,430
That word again

6
00:00:26,430 --> 00:00:27,930
I also wrote this in my previous life.

7
00:00:27,930 --> 00:00:29,430
They believed it all

8
00:00:29,430 --> 00:00:31,430
I thought someone would come to save me soon

9
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:32,930
You won't know until you come back to your senses

10
00:00:32,930 --> 00:00:34,430
No one is coming

11
00:00:34,430 --> 00:00:36,930
The whole country is left to fend for itself
